qrscan reads every QR code and barcode in an image file and prints a JSON
report. It works offline: no account, no upload and no network access.

It reads QR Code, Micro QR, rMQR, Data Matrix, Aztec, PDF417, MaxiCode,
EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, Codabar, ITF,
GS1 DataBar and Telepen. The report keeps the payload bytes and the position
of each code, and gives each QR code a scannability score.
